    {
      "rowData": {
        "widgetData": {
          "content": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">After two recent cup games, County return to league action on Saturday to take on promotion rivals Reading, so join us in the County Courtyard for a big game as we go in search of a fifth straight home league win.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The Courtyard has become the place to be for County fans in the build-up to matchday at Edgeley Park, with the opportunity to enjoy drink, mouth-watering food and County-themed entertainment alongside your fellow Hatters.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Arrive early to enjoy Happy Hour:</strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Supporters who arrive early at Edgeley Park will be able to enjoy our new Happy Hour in the County Courtyard, with a 25% discount available on all food and drink this Saturday from 12pm-1pm.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Our Happy Hour discount will be available at all league fixtures this season, so get yourself down to the Courtyard early this weekend and help us get Edgeley Park rocking ahead of kick-off!</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Post-Match Food Fire Sale:</strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Join us in the County Courtyard after the game and digest the game over some food and a post-match drink! Any unsold hot food on matchday will be taken over to the Courtyard following the final whistle, and will be available to buy for just &pound;2 per item - with that discounted price available until it's all gone!</p>",
          "contentDouble": null,
          "imageKey": null,
