    {
      "rowData": {
        "widgetData": {
          "content": "<p><strong>What's on offer this Saturday?</strong></p>\n<p>Join us at Edgeley Park this Saturday, as Jimmy McNulty's side look to move level on points with Huddersfield Town at the top of the table.</p>\n<p>Doors will officially open at&nbsp;<strong>12</strong><strong>p</strong><strong>m</strong> on Saturday ahead of our 3pm kick-off, so head down early and take advantage of our Happy Hour discount! The food on offer this week includes a chicken curry with rice and naan bread, alongside all your usual matchday favourite pies and hotdogs.</p>\n<p>As ever, we have special guests appearing live on stage for a Q&amp;A session, with FA Youth Cup stars Alfie Jones and Richard Ilara joining us at 1.45pm on Saturday - don&rsquo;t miss your chance to get pictures and autographs with our academy stars!</p>\n<p>The Courtyard will be open at half-time for supporters sat in the Cheadle End, and again at full-time for anyone wanting to talk about the game over a post-match drink, or enjoy hot food for just &pound;2!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
